Comment:
 Unofficial binary build. ElegooSlicer is derived from OrcaSlicer, which is
 derived from BambuStudio, PrusaSlicer and Slic3r. The program statically
 bundles third-party libraries (Boost, wxWidgets, OpenCASCADE, CGAL, OpenVDB,
 TBB, ...); their sources and licenses are part of the upstream source tree
 referenced above. The full upstream license text is installed as
 /usr/share/doc/elegoo-slicer/LICENSE.
 .
 The bundled elegoo-link library is built from
 https://github.com/ELEGOO-3D/elegoo-link, commit @ELEGOOLINK_REF@.
 Patches applied to the upstream source are published in the packaging
 repository.

